    HeadlessKorbloxGui.lua
    -----------------------
    A LocalScript that creates a simple GUI with two toggle buttons:
      1. "Enable Headless" - hides your character's head (client-side only)
      2. "Enable Korblox"  - lets you pick a leg (Left/Right) and swaps it
                             for a Korblox Deathspeaker leg (client-side only)

    Place this in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts, or in StarterGui
    as a LocalScript. It only affects what YOU see on your own client
    unless the game itself replicates appearance changes (most don't).
]]

